OL,4,BCowboy boots, cocktails and casinos -  
OL,5,Bhow do three US grands prix compare?   
OL,6,G"The picnic blanket that you'd happily 
OL,7,Gsit on in Austin will get confiscated  
OL,8,Gby security at Miami and will end up   
OL,9,Gwrapped around you in the chill of a   
OL,10,GVegas night."                          
OL,12,FCadence Kim from Dallas lives the      
OL,13,Freality of being an avid Formula 1 fan 
OL,14,Fin the United States, in the three     
OL,15,Fdiverse locations the sport now        
OL,16,Ffrequents. She will be among the       
OL,17,F300,000 spectators around the iconic   
OL,18,FLas Vegas Strip this weekend.          
